              "sourceRegion": "Question 12(b), paired rectangles",
              "description": "Horizontal pair of equal outer rectangles. The right rectangle contains a tilted rectangular white hole. No dimensions or centre marks are supplied.",
              "mathematics": "Compare an intact rectangle with a rectangular region after removal of a smaller rotated rectangle.",
              "answerVisibility": "No bisection line or centres are shown."
