            "derived": false,
            "reviewStatus": "needs-review"
          }
        ],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "Draw the straight line through the centres of both rectangles.",
          "worked": "Find each rectangle's centre by intersecting its diagonals. Draw the line through the two centres. It bisects both the larger rectangle and the removed rectangle, so subtracting half the removed area from each half of the larger area leaves equal areas.",
